{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41516","headline":"松 · 廖匡图","name":"松","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"曾於西晋封中散，又向东吴作大夫。\n浓翠自知千古在，清声谁道四时无。\n枝柯偃後龙蛇老，根脚盘来爪距粗。\n直待素秋摇落日，始将凡木鬬荣枯。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"廖匡图","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41516.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41516","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}